<title>USA: Magna to repurchase up to 5 pct of shares.</title>
<headline>Magna to repurchase up to 5 pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magna Group Inc on Monday said it planned to repurchase up to 1.7 million shares, or about five percent of its common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>The bank holding company said it would use the shares to meet obligations under stock-option and other benefit plans.</p>
<p>As of March 31, Magna had 33.1 million shares of common stock outstanding, it said.</p>
<p>Magna approved a similar plan in 1995 which it completed in May with the repurchase of 1.37 million shares, it said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
